    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi @echasnovski,\r\nI use mini.pick and have a question. I hope you can answer it.\r\nDo you have any plans to make mini.pick match items in any order, like fzf-lua does?\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1035\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2fc8c88b-8245-4560-909b-8b918048e72a\" />\r\n\r\nNow I use mini.pick as the default picker in my config, so I hope this feature will be added to mini.pick.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/echasnovski/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski\">@echasnovski</a>,<br>\nI use mini.pick and have a question. I hope you can answer it.<br>\nDo you have any plans to make mini.pick match items in any order, like fzf-lua does?</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/20609495/397321715-2fc8c88b-8245-4560-909b-8b918048e72a.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..PqoF-NyWbehoh7uwzBhWc-XKvD_tUpg7FO4nq015CUM\"><img width=\"1035\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/20609495/397321715-2fc8c88b-8245-4560-909b-8b918048e72a.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..PqoF-NyWbehoh7uwzBhWc-XKvD_tUpg7FO4nq015CUM\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Now I use mini.pick as the default picker in my config, so I hope this feature will be added to mini.pick.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi @echasnovski,\nI use mini.pick and have a question. I hope you can answer it.\nDo you have any plans to make mini.pick match items in any order, like fzf-lua does?\n\nNow I use mini.pick as the default picker in my config, so I hope this feature will be added to mini.pick.",
    "category": {
